        "text": "幅度谱 $\\left|F_{n}\\right|\\sim n\\omega_{1}$ ，相位谱 $\\varphi_{n}\\sim n\\omega_{1}(n\\text{取}-\\infty\\text{到}\\infty)$",
        "bbox": [
