        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nF _ {n} = | F _ {n} | e ^ {j \\varphi_ {n}} = \\frac {1}{2} (a _ {n} - j b _ {n})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            371,
