        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{c} {| F _ {n} | = | F _ {- n} | = \\frac {1}{2} c _ {n} = \\frac {1}{2} \\sqrt {a _ {n} ^ {2} + b _ {n} ^ {2}}} \\\\ {F _ {n} + F _ {- n} = a _ {n}} \\\\ {b _ {n} = j (F _ {n} - F _ {- n})} \\\\ {(n = 1, 2, \\dots)} \\end{array}\n$$",
